<%@ page contentType="text/html;charset=UTF-8" language="java" %>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Urent - Panel de vendedor</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; }
        body { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; min-height: 100vh; background-color: #f4f7f6; padding: 1rem; }
        .tarjeta { background: #ffffff; padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); width: 100%; max-width: 480px; text-align: center; }
        .tarjeta h1 { color: #2c3e50; font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
        .tarjeta p { color: #555; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
        .btn-salir { display: inline-block; padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem; background-color: #dc3545; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; }
        .btn-salir:hover { background-color: #bd2130; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="tarjeta">
        <h1>Panel de vendedor</h1>
        <p>Estamos construyendo esta sección. Pronto podrás publicar y administrar tus alojamientos.</p>
        <a class="btn-salir" href="logout">Cerrar Sesión</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
